-- Migration 041: 50 more real, local Georgia organizations, all distinct from
-- migrations 008 and 036-040 (verified: zero org-name overlap with the prior 314).
-- Coverage across many cities: Columbus, Macon, Augusta, Albany, Savannah,
-- Brunswick, Valdosta, Moultrie, LaGrange, Dalton, Statesboro, Gainesville,
-- Carrollton, Marietta, Roswell, Lawrenceville, Decatur, Chamblee, Athens,
-- Mansfield, Rabun Gap, and Atlanta. Each org was researched individually and
-- its website/volunteer page verified. Pure inserts with fixed ids - safe to
-- re-run, existing rows untouched.

